# Path to the LibreOffice / soffice binary used by the office-to-pdf tool.
# Optional. If unset, the app tries the platform default install location,
# then falls back to looking for `soffice` on PATH.
#
# Windows default: C:\Program Files\LibreOffice\program\soffice.exe
# macOS default:   /Applications/LibreOffice.app/Contents/MacOS/soffice
# Linux default:   /usr/bin/soffice
# LIBREOFFICE_PATH=

# Path to the Ghostscript binary used by the compress-pdf tool. Optional.
# If unset, the app looks for `gswin64c`/`gswin32c` (Windows) or `gs`
# (macOS/Linux) on PATH, plus the common Homebrew install locations on macOS.
# GHOSTSCRIPT_PATH=
